{"about_the_game":"<strong>DEMO vs Full Version<br><br>DEMO:<br>1. Open Story Maps: Debut, Sail, Dungeon, DragFall, Homecoming<br>2. Open Race: France<br>3. Open Heroes: 6 heroes<br><br>Full Version:<br>1. Open 8 Selected Maps<br>2. Open 11 Random Maps<br>3. Open All Races: Mongolia, France, Japan, China, Egypt, Rome<br>4. Open All Heroes: 37 heroes<br>5. At least 48 troop types<br>6. At least 75 equipment types<br>7. At least 56 skill types</strong><br><br><strong>A troop-clash strategy game. Choose your hero, command minions, crush enemy formations! Inspired by Heroes of Might &amp; Magic and Hero's Hour. Multiple races with national styles like Huaxia and France. Random maps = unique fun every game! Endless development &amp; combat!  </strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897150/extras/6647176f118157cf1680dd7a281bd92d.webp?t=1754020899\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897150/extras/8485cfa6c76d7b34128b5a1ab237ded0.poster.avif?t=1754020899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897150/extras/8485cfa6c76d7b34128b5a1ab237ded0.webm?t=1754020899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897150/extras/8485cfa6c76d7b34128b5a1ab237ded0.mp4?t=1754020899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Recruit legendary heroes with unique skills and distinct personalities! Each hero possesses powerful, unique abilities and growth paths. As the soul of your civilization, they lead the era, and their decisions profoundly impact the rise and fall of your empire.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897150/extras/b69231bb99cc8